# 7.0.0: runtime scratch, pharn-cli's backups and its lock file live under pharn/ now. `.pharn/` stays ignored
# for its `ci.yml` exception (pharn-ci still reads `.pharn/ci.yml`) and for scratch left by a pre-7.0.0 checkout.
pharn/.run/
pharn/.backup/
pharn/.lock*
runs/
.env
.DS_Store
coverage/
# Claude Code's own worktrees (other sessions' checkouts), formerly excluded only through .git/info/exclude.
.claude/worktrees/

